OL,3,GNEWSACat poisoning fears spark warnings
OL,4,Aafter deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FPet owners in a town have been warned
OL,7,Fto keep watch over their animals after
OL,8,Freports of suspected cat poisonings.
OL,10,FShelley, which is not her real name,
OL,11,Fsaid her two-year-old cat Jasmine went
OL,12,Fmissing in the West Lane area of
OL,13,FMiddlesbrough on 30 October.
OL,15,FShe later found her pet in her garden
OL,16,Fcrying out in pain, before having to
OL,17,Ftake it to the vet to be put to sleep.
OL,18,FShe said her neighbour's cat died in
OL,19,Fsimilar circumstances days later.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
