OL,3,GNEWSACat poisoning fears spark warnings
OL,4,Aafter deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FCleveland Police confirmed it was
OL,7,Finvestigating a suspected poisoning in
OL,8,FAbbeygate, Middlesbrough, and urged
OL,9,Fanyone else who suspected their cat had
OL,10,Fingested something toxic to get in
OL,11,Ftouch.
